function renderReport(a){const m=a.metrics,o=a.overlapBlockClosure,b=o.boundaryReview,lines=["# 🟠 WATCH — Concrete async-exit exposure","",`**Classification:** ${a.classification}`,"","> Conditional Medium source/fork finding retained. Configuration overlap is not consumer impact, loss, or extraction.","","## Historical coverage and transaction boundary","",`- Deployment→fixed coverage: ${m.coverageBlocks} blocks, chunks=${m.logChunks}, failures=${m.logFailures}. Complete=${a.logCoverage.complete}; complete event history relies on bounded public-explorer pagination because public RPC range responses omitted logs.`,`- Raw explorer logs=${m.rawExplorerLogs}; deduplicated raw logs=${m.deduplicatedRawLogs}; selected relevant decoded events=${m.selectedRelevantEvents}; ignored known/unknown-topic events=${m.ignoredKnownTopicEvents}/${m.ignoredUnknownTopicEvents}.`,`- Overlap began after tx index ${b.deploymentTransactionIndex} in block ${DEPLOY}; ten consistent post-block checkpoints cover ${DEPLOY} through ${DEPLOY+9}; overlap ended before tx index ${b.updateTransactionIndex} in block ${DEPLOY+10}.`,`- Direct proxy calls: ${b.directProxyCalls}; direct exit calls: ${b.directExitCalls}; internal/reverted exit attempts: unknown — trace unavailable.`,`- All ten post-block checkpoints reported totalSupply=0. Logged Transfer mint/burn replay from the first post-block checkpoint produced observed delta ${b.eventReplay.observedTotalSupplyDelta}; internal or unlogged supply changes are not assumed absent.`,`- Boundary receipt coverage: ${b.segments.map(x=>`${x.label}=${x.receiptCoverage}`).join(", ")}. Ordered direct calls and event counts are in the raw artifact.`,"","## Lifecycle and consumers","",`- Queue lifecycle counts: ${JSON.stringify(a.lifecycle.counts)}`,`- Holders observed/contracts=${m.holders}/${m.contractHolders}; approvals=${m.approvalEvents}; current nonzero allowances=${m.currentNonzeroAllowances}.`,`- Observed/source-classified code-bearing contracts=${m.observedCodeBearingContracts}/${m.sourceClassifiedContracts}; proven synchronous consumers=${m.provenConsumerExposureRows}.`,"","## Mitigation","","Separate asynchronous requests into an ERC-7540-style API, or force the queue inactive for ERC-4626 withdraw/redeem; align maxWithdraw/maxRedeem with actual executable behavior and do not return nominal synchronous assets when settlement is queued.","","## Disposition","",`- Vulnerability/loss/extraction/route rows=${m.vulnerabilityRows}/${m.lossRows}/${m.extractionRows}/${m.routeRows}.`,`- Gates=${JSON.stringify(a.gates)}`,"",...a.blockers.map(x=>`- ${x}`),""];const text=lines.join("\n");assertRendering(text,"report");return text}
